{
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-04.txt/0": "但事实是，这个世界上到处都是\r\n连这么明显的事都做不到的人。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-05.txt/0": "也包括那些一直守护家人，直到\r\n\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]把他们吞没的人。\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，保护你的家人吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-06.txt/0": "不过这样说也不太准确。\r\n你现在要守护的是整个世界。\r\n那是更重大的责任。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-07.txt/0": "但想守护的事物，\r\n其实并没有大小之分吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-08.txt/0": "也许吧。\r\n但我两边都没能保护。\r\n我、我抛下了家人……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-09.txt/0": "你确定不是他们抛下了你吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-10.txt/0": "正好相反。逃走的人是我。\r\n那时候……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-11.txt/0": "\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]已逼近头顶。\r\n想逃也来不及了，它马上就要吞没我们。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-12.txt/0": "可我手里只有够一个人使用的\r\n“\\c[52]传送药剂\\c[0]”。于是我一口喝下……\r\n独自逃走。我……我抛弃了家人！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-13.txt/0": "说吧，你尽管骂。我是人渣。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-14.txt/0": "…… …… …… …… …… ……\r\n嗯……所以呢……\r\n你想让我说你是人渣？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-15.txt/0": "……咦？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-16.txt/0": "如果因此被骂，反而会让你心里好受些吧？\r\n所以为了你的家人，我才不骂你。\r\n有意见吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c04/fs008c04-17.txt/0": "原来如此。真遗憾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-01.txt/0": "\\c[51]Cole\\c[0]，\r\n我上次说得太过分了。抱歉。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-02.txt/0": "没人想死，对吧？\r\n如果你觉得被审判、被责骂能让你好受，\r\n随时告诉我。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-03.txt/0": "不，我不需要安慰。\r\n我是最差劲的人。\r\n差劲到活着毫无价值。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-04.txt/0": "现在……\r\n我只是想协助你完成任务，以此赎罪。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-05.txt/0": "靠讨伐\\c[52]灾厄的使者\\c[0]赎罪？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-06.txt/0": "或者说……是在寻找葬身之地吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-07.txt/0": "我独自逃出后，被山贼在胸口留下这道伤疤。\r\n敌人的刀刃一直刺进了我的心脏。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-08.txt/0": "所以，最终……我活不了多久。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-09.txt/0": "在那一天到来前，很抱歉要让你容忍\r\n我这样可悲的人作为旅途同伴。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-10.txt/0": "因为想逃而逃，因为想死而死……\r\n一切都只是为了我自己。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-11.txt/0": "既然如此，我要把剩下的时间献给\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。请随意使唤我吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-12.txt/0": "我可不像\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]那么善良，\r\n所以不会怜悯你。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-13.txt/0": "不过，既然你还活着……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-14.txt/0": "与其被绝望吞噬，\r\n不如先把人生走到最后再死。\r\n为了你死去的家人。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-15.txt/0": "如果这还不够，就想想可怜的\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，\r\n居然收留了你这样的人。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-16.txt/0": "你说得对。我要从酒瓶里爬出来，\r\n为了这个世界，也为了你们，好好努力……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs008c05/fs008c05-17.txt/0": "呵呵。你放下酒，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]一定也会赞同。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-01.txt/0": "这是什么，真的是\\c[52]龙\\c[0]吗？\r\n好小啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-02.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-03.txt/0": "哦，我会说\\c[52]龙语\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-04.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-05.txt/0": "你被困在峡谷里出不来？\r\n嗯？不会飞？可你明明有翅膀！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-06.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-07.txt/0": "咦，只是装饰？\r\n而且你居然还敢承认！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-08.txt/0": "好吧，看来只能帮它了。\r\n这个小家伙自己肯定出不来。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-09.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-10.txt/0": "咦？你说别把你当小孩？\r\n好吧，那就把你留在这里，怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-11.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-12.txt/0": "什么？你说我不是人？\r\n没错，因为我是\\c[52]妖精\\c[0]。\r\n事实上，我确实不是人类。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-13.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-14.txt/0": "咦？你求英俊的勇者和年轻的美女帮你？\r\n行吧行吧，我们帮你。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-15.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-16.txt/0": "什么？你饿了？还顺便告诉我们\r\n你最喜欢的食物是飞鱼？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-17.txt/0": "……这家伙真是够了。\r\n说实话，我现在已经有点火了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-18.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c01/fs010c01-19.txt/0": "咦？不仅如此，你还想加入我们？\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，你怎么看？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-01.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-02.txt/0": "好，从今天起你就是我们的一员！\r\n一起拯救世界吧！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-03.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-04.txt/0": "这个小家伙到底听懂了没有……？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-05.txt/0": "啾啾？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-06.txt/0": "然后你问人类通常是不是穿衣服？\r\n嗯……现在……一般来说，也许吧。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-07.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-08.txt/0": "没错，还得给你起个名字。\r\n嗯……既然是幼年\\c[52]龙\\c[0]，就叫\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-09.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-10.txt/0": "说我没创意？别再说了！\r\n连\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]都满意，就这么定了！\r\n从今天起，你叫\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-11.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-12.txt/0": "哦，真的，谢谢。\r\n它说听习惯之后就不错。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-13.txt/0": "还有，谢谢你救了它。\r\n虽然说得有点晚。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-14.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-15.txt/0": "它之所以警惕，是因为有很多团伙\r\n会假装救它，再把它卖个大价钱？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-16.txt/0": "所以它是为了躲开商人，才卡在那里？\r\n你自己也挺见多识广的，嗯？\r\n虽然你并不是人类。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-17.txt/0": "啾。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-18.txt/0": "……\r\n那么，有人能拿你卖多少钱？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c02/fs010c02-19.txt/0": "\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]加入了队伍！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c03/fs010c03-01.txt/0": "啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c03/fs010c03-02.txt/0": "很遗憾，没有得到\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的许可，\r\n我们不能带你走。\r\n抱歉。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c03/fs010c03-03.txt/0": "啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c04/fs010c04-01.txt/0": "呃，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。\r\n你还是改变主意了？\r\n想让Draco加入我们？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c05/fs010c05-01.txt/0": "咔嚓，咔嚓，咔嚓！\r\n咔嚓，咔嚓，咔嚓！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c05/fs010c05-02.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊！！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c06/fs010c06-01.txt/0": "啾、啾啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c06/fs010c06-02.txt/0": "咦？又说算了？\r\n差点被卖掉的事吓到你了吗？\r\n喂，刚才明明让我们充满期待！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs010c06/fs010c06-03.txt/0": "很遗憾，看来我们只是缺乏\r\n让它加入的魅力。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-01.txt/0": "咦，你比上次长大一点了？\r\n都快和我一样高了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-02.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-03.txt/0": "哎哟，哎哟哎哟！\r\n够了！别蹭我的脸了！\r\n你的……皮肤？鳞片？又尖又疼！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-04.txt/0": "啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-05.txt/0": "哦……别那么沮丧。\r\n好吧好吧，允许你蹭我的脸！\r\n但要轻一点，知道吗！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-06.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-07.txt/0": "咦？你想把这条鱼给我们？\r\n但我有不吃生食的原则。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-08.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-09.txt/0": "哎呀，小心！\r\n别突然喷火啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-10.txt/0": "哦……你把鱼烤熟了。\r\n这样的话我就能吃。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-11.txt/0": "啾。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-12.txt/0": "咦？\r\n吃了这个就当你的女朋友？\r\n我、我为什么要和你交往？！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-13.txt/0": "啾。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-14.txt/0": "什么叫因为我们体型一样？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-15.txt/0": "听好了！我就是不喜欢不会飞的\r\n\\c[52]龙\\c[0]，明白吗？？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-16.txt/0": "啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c02/fs011c02-17.txt/0": "唉，现在它又消沉了……\r\n嗯……我也不是非要把你推开？\r\n算了，我也没别的办法。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-01.txt/0": "哇，你什么时候又长大了？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-02.txt/0": "啾啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-03.txt/0": "哇，它现在在练习飞行。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-04.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-05.txt/0": "这证明你背后的翅膀\r\n不只是装饰，对吧？\r\n不，最开始这么说的人明明是你！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-06.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-07.txt/0": "什么？\r\n如果你能飞，就想让我和你约会？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-08.txt/0": "呃，好吧……\r\n如果你真的能飞，那行，我们可以约会。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-09.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-10.txt/0": "好吧，那么，\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]，\r\n先问一下，你到底是雄性还是雌性？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-11.txt/0": "啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-12.txt/0": "雄性？真的？那就确认一下……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-13.txt/0": "喂，你可是\\c[52]龙\\c[0]，别这么害羞！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c03/fs011c03-14.txt/0": "啾啾啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-01.txt/0": "哇，快看，天上有一大群飞鱼！\r\n\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]，如果你会飞，就能随便吃了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-02.txt/0": "啾啊啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-03.txt/0": "你想让我看看练习成果？\r\n嗯，好吧，就让你展示一下。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-04.txt/0": "啾啊……\r\n啾啊啊……\r\n啾啊啊啊……啾啊啊啊……！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-05.txt/0": "……真可惜。\r\n你飞起了一点，但这还算不上飞行。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-06.txt/0": "啾！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-07.txt/0": "这么点挫折就让你放弃了吗？\r\n好吧，看来你还真是个男孩子。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-08.txt/0": "啾啊……\r\n啾啊啊……\r\n啾啊啊啊……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-09.txt/0": "啾啊啊……！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-10.txt/0": "来吧，继续尝试。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-11.txt/0": "啾啊啊……！！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-12.txt/0": "再坚持一下！\r\n努力飞起来！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-13.txt/0": "啾……",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-14.txt/0": "唉，它放弃了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-15.txt/0": "呜，现在它又难过了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-16.txt/0": "你练了这么久，也长大了不少，\r\n我还以为也许能行，看来还是不行。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-17.txt/0": "我倒不是特别难过……\r\n嗯，我是说，如果你真的能飞，\r\n我就不得不和你约会了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c04/fs011c04-18.txt/0": "我是说，你听说过\\c[52]龙\\c[0]\r\n和\\c[52]妖精\\c[0]成为情侣吗？没有吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-01.txt/0": "啾……啾……啾……啾啊啊啊！\r\n啾啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-02.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，快看快看快看！\r\n\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]终于会飞了！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-03.txt/0": "嗯……虽然它现在只能飞过几栋建筑，\r\n不过好歹能飞。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-04.txt/0": "啾啊。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-05.txt/0": "这也要多谢英俊的勇者和美丽的小姐？\r\n嗯，连说话都像长大了。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-06.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-07.txt/0": "咦？你说我答应过要和你约会？\r\n呃，嗯……可恶，我算是被套住了。\r\n好吧，既然约定了，那就可以约会。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-08.txt/0": "但要等世界恢复和平以后。\r\n现在没空做那种事，\r\n你长大了，应该明白吧？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-09.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-10.txt/0": "咦？所以你要流血流汗流泪，\r\n帮助\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-11.txt/0": "呃，流血流汗流泪……\r\n你现在还真会说话。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-12.txt/0": "你现在已经有我身高的\\c[53]三倍多\\c[0]了。\r\n你真的长大了，\\c[51]Draco\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-13.txt/0": "说实话，我现在有点感动。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs011c05/fs011c05-14.txt/0": "啾啊啊啊啊！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-01.txt/0": "哦？呵呵……\r\n你好啊，看起来人不错！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-02.txt/0": "如果你请我喝一杯，\r\n我也许会做点好事回报你。怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-03.txt/0": "你想请我喝一杯……？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-04.txt/0": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，你被搭讪了。\r\n最好的办法就是无视她。",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-05.txt/0": "哎呀，不带我一起走吗？",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-06.txt/0": "哎呀，不带我一起走吗？\r\n而且你看起来那么自由开放——",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-07.txt/0": "我们可是在进行拯救世界的\r\n生死之旅！\r\n你也该有点眼力吧！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-08.txt/0": "嗯。那个\\c[52]灾厄的使者\\c[0]啊。\r\n嘿，听起来还挺有趣的！",
  "message/data/event/mes/friend/fs013c01/fs013c01-09.txt/0": "既然说到这个！\r\n能不能让我也加入你们的征途？"
}
